### ADMIN ENDPOINT - ADMIN ONLY - Login Required
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin

### Register a Patient - Login and CSRF Required
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patients
X-XSRF-TOKEN:

### GET ALL Patients - Login Required
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients

### GET  Patient by ID - Login Required
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/1

### UPDATE Patient - Login and CSRF Required
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/patients/1
X-XSRF-TOKEN:

### DELETE Patient - Login and CSRF Required
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/patients/1
X-XSRF-TOKEN:

### Search Patient By PhoneNumber - Login, CSRF, and pass request param
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/search

### Search Patient By PhoneNumber - Login, CSRF and pass phone number as PathVariable
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/phone/{{phoneNumber}}

### Get Encounter by ID - Login, CSRF and pass encounter Id as PathVariable
GET http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/

### Get Encounter by Patient ID - Login, CSRF and pass patient Id as PathVariable
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{patientId}}/

### Get Encounter by ID - Login, CSRF and pass encounter Id as PathVariable
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/discharge

### Cancel Encounter by ID - Login, CSRF and pass encounter Id as PathVariable
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/cancel


### Create Medical Record - Login, CSRF and pass encounter Id as PathVariable
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record

### Get Medical Record - Login, CSRF and pass encounter Id as PathVariable
GET http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record

### Adds vital a medical record belonging to the encounter - Login, CSRF and pass encounter Id as PathVariable
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/vitals

### Adds clinical observation to the medical record belonging to the encounter - Login, CSRF and pass encounter Id as PathVariable
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/observations

### Adds diagnosis to the medical record belonging to the encounter - Login, CSRF and pass encounter Id as PathVariable
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/diagnoses

### Adds treatment to the medical record belonging to the encounter - Login, CSRF and pass encounter Id as PathVariable
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encounters/{{encounterId}}/medical-record/treatments
